      },
      "lineNbr": 323,
      "author": {
        "id": 1951687
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-01-22T09:44:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There\u0027s two advantages in doing this later:\n\n* The reclaim won\u0027t happen until this is flip, which is nice for the series because I can plug all the infra and the hyp will still say \"nope!\"\n\n* We do the host stage-2 prepopulate and hyp_pool init before the vmemmap is ready (fix_host_ownership_walker) happens. So the coalescing function can\u0027t rely on hyp_state to know if the page is mapped or not, they would all appear unmapped by then. Hence why I have this -\u003erange_reclaimable \u0026\u0026 get_hyp_state(buddy).",
      "parentUuid": "67288541_5e68aa79",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 308,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 323,
        "endChar": 1
      },
      "revId": "856d6551c01b47dd5e521c60cb9fef63475b49be",
